      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VOODOO MAC (1) was strongly supported last start but missed the frame when fourth (22.20), beaten 9 lengths. Better than last start and worth following up. GOLDSTAR IMOGEN (7) has missed the frame at her last couple but wasn't beaten far three back when second (20.06) at this track in a Maiden. Well placed here and should do much better. FRONT SEAT BETTY (2) is still a maiden after 15 runs but rarely far away, the latest finishing out of the placings when fourth at this track. Bold showing expected. THUNDER WONDER (8) is by Aston Rupee out of Days Of Thunder making debut. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Profiles nicely and can feature in the finish.",
